OL,3,GNEWSARecycled school uniform project
OL,4,Asees demand soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Joanne McCarthy set up a school
OL,7,Funiforms recycling project five years
OL,8,Fago, she had just two bags of
OL,9,Fdonations, but half a decade on,
OL,10,FUni-Recycle in Sheffield has thousands
OL,11,Fof items which it sells at a fraction
OL,12,Fof the price they would cost new - or
OL,13,Fit gives them away to families most in
OL,14,Fneed.
OL,16,FMcCarthy said recently demand for what
OL,17,Fthe project offered had "gone through
OL,18,Fthe roof" and 2026 had been the
OL,19,F"busiest year".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
