OL,3,GNEWSARecycled school uniform project
OL,4,Asees demand soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a new law came into
OL,7,Fforce this month limiting school
OL,8,Funiforms to just three branded items -
OL,9,Fsomething the government said would
OL,10,Fsave some families "up to #50 per
OL,11,Fchild".
OL,13,FUni-Recycle is a not-for-profit
OL,14,Fcommunity interest company that runs
OL,15,Fpop-up shops at Heeley Parish Church
OL,16,Fand is supported by charities and
OL,17,Fsupermarkets.
